<title>ITALY: Italy's Finmeccanica rejects talk of Ansaldo sale.</title>
<headline>Italy's Finmeccanica rejects talk of Ansaldo sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian state controlled engineering group Finmeccanica in a statement rejected press rumours that it was involved in talks to sell off its unit Ansaldo Trasporti.</p>
<p>&quot;Finmeccanica denies the existence of talks over the sale of Ansaldo Trasporti,&quot; the company said. It added that it was presently looking to strengthen its position in the transport manufacturing sector and not weaken it. -- Rome newsroom +396 678280</p>
</text>
